{"agda":{"module":"Lintel.Lattice","names":["⊑-refl","⊑-trans","⊑-antisym","⊔-upper₁","⊔-upper₂","⊔-least","⊓-lower₁","⊓-lower₂","⊓-greatest","anyone-least","no-one-greatest","no-one-⋢-anyone","_⊑?_"]},"claim":"L-1","id":"metadatastician/lintel#L-1","kind":"theorem","receipt":null,"repo":"metadatastician/lintel","source_commit":"a0f2bae9cac07cd97b2395d10d0eb05f8ae1c7d1","statement":"A lattice, not just a poset: ⊑ is a decidable partial order, ⊔ and ⊓ are least upper and greatest lower bounds, anyone is least and no-one greatest","status_doc":"README.adoc"}
